proton-autogen (3.4.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Thanks to all users and contributors for their continued support, feedback and bug reports.
  * Added support for additional Proton environment variables to improve compatibility with GE-Proton-11-10.
  * Added environment variables related to controller effects, DualSense haptics, Sony controller compatibility, memory address space management, and Wayland fullscreen handling.
  * Added project activity statistics to the documentation.
  * Added a project roadmap to track planned features and development tasks.
  * Added detailed documentation describing Proton-Autogen's features.
  * Added integration instructions and improved installation guidance.
  * Improved visual themes and applied additional theme fixes.
  * New UX/UI Theme – Modern CSS – Updated Images – Professional Design
  * Expand UI and CSS integrity checks to prevent regressions.
  * Improve Proton, Steam and Flatpak runtime integration.
  * Improve Debian, Flatpak and AUR package validation and build workflows.
  * Improve application and game profile management and stability.
  * Improve application data, executable path and prefix handling.
  * Add game import functionality to recover applications from Lutris and other supported sources.
  * Add system monitoring with CPU and memory usage information.
  * Improve application status reporting and runtime monitoring.
  * Improve dashboard responsiveness and overall user experience.
  * Improve application import workflow and user interface.
  * Improve Flatpak support, packaging and installation documentation.
  * Add Flatpak build and validation workflow.
  * Add AUR package validation and build checks.
  * Improve Debian package metadata and build configuration.
  * Add automated package and integration validation workflows.
  * Add comprehensive automated tests for core functionality, profiles, CLI, Gamescope and integrity checks.
  * Add CSS integrity tests to help prevent UI regressions.
  * Improve localization support across all supported languages.
  * Improve application data and path handling.
  * Improve Proton and Flatpak integration.
  * Improve documentation with dedicated guides for Proton prefixes, Windows applications and game execution.
  * Improve application profile management and stability.
  * Improve graphical styles and responsive UI behavior.
  * Remove obsolete system tray implementation.
  * Improve code organization, cleanup and maintainability.
  * Fix various UI, packaging and integration issues.
  * General UX improvements, configuration handling improvements and code cleanup.

